WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.145
Daisy: What happened, Jenna?

2
00:00:12.146 --> 00:00:16.008
Jenna: The problem is that I like chapter books.

3
00:00:16.009 --> 00:00:19.949
Jenna: Really long chapter books!

4
00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.479
Mark: You'll catch up.

5
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.273
Daisy: You can do it, Jenna.

6
00:00:23.274 --> 00:00:31.342
You're a reading superstar!

7
00:00:31.343 --> 00:00:35.752
Jenna: Dad, can you take me to the library?

8
00:00:35.753 --> 00:00:38.406
Mr. Gibson: Did you finish all those chapter books?

9
00:00:38.407 --> 00:00:42.912
Jenna: I finished one of them.

10
00:00:42.913 --> 00:00:49.621
Jenna: Now I need some more books—Shorter ones!

11
00:00:49.622 --> 00:00:51.758
Mrs. Gibson: Lights out, honey.

12
00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:57.562
Jenna: In a minute, Mom.

13
00:00:57.563 --> 00:01:00.210
Mr. Gibson: Jenna! Daisy's here.

14
00:01:00.211 --> 00:01:01.527
Time for school.

15
00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:09.704
Jenna: Coming!

16
00:01:09.705 --> 00:01:12.027
Daisy: Let's go jump rope, Jenna.

17
00:01:12.028 --> 00:01:15.598
Jenna: No, thanks. I'm staying inside to read.

18
00:01:15.599 --> 00:01:17.629
Juan: Me too.

19
00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:25.074
Jim: Me too.

20
00:01:25.075 --> 00:01:29.141
Miss Gray: Good morning. I've got an important announcement.

21
00:01:29.142 --> 00:01:32.935
Miss Gray: Room Two readers are superstars!

22
00:01:32.936 --> 00:01:35.424
Class: Hooray!

23
00:01:35.425 --> 00:01:38.795
Coby: We did it!

24
00:01:38.796 --> 00:01:42.268
We read 111 books!

25
00:01:42.269 --> 00:01:46.295
Kara: I read 14 books—more than Jenna.

26
00:01:46.296 --> 00:01:48.009
Jenna: So what, Kara?

27
00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:51.688
I read ten and that helped us win the prize.

28
00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:57.071
Daisy: Yeah. Our class did it together.

29
00:01:57.072 --> 00:02:00.271
Mr. Miller: Congratulations, Room Two.

30
00:02:00.272 --> 00:02:02.760
Jenna: What's our prize, Mr. Miller?

31
00:02:02.761 --> 00:02:05.940
Daisy: Are you going to dance on the roof?

32
00:02:05.941 --> 00:02:10.138
Mark: Can I throw a pie at you?

33
00:02:10.139 --> 00:02:12.877
Mr. Miller: You'll find out tomorrow.

34
00:02:12.878 --> 00:02:31.001
Mr. Miller: Please come to the gym at two o'clock.

35
00:02:31.002 --> 00:02:34.738
Mark: Wow! Cool! It's a dunk tank!

36
00:02:34.739 --> 00:02:56.272
Coby: When you hit the target, you dunk the principal!

37
00:02:56.273 --> 00:02:57.770
Daisy: This is fun.

38
00:02:57.771 --> 00:03:00.075
Almost as much fun as—

39
00:03:00.076 --> 00:03:09.346
Jenna: Reading!
